"""
Export the swing-up controller as standalone C and, optionally, run it on the QUBE.

Everything about building and running the program comes from `QubeHardwareRunBase`; what is
specific to this analysis is the LQR design weights below. `export_c` defaults to true here
because the C sources are the deliverable — the run is a bonus.
"""
partial analysis FurutaExportCBase
  extends QubeHardwareRunBase(export_c = true, Tf = 10.0)
  "LQR state-penalty diagonal in the order [shoulder_angle, elbow_angle, shoulder_velocity, elbow_velocity]"
  parameter Q1::Real[4] = [1000.0, 10.0, 1.0, 1.0]
  "LQR control-penalty weight"
  parameter Q2::Real = 100.0
relations
end
